  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Acute declines in refined fuel availability (diesel, gasoline) disrupt transport, power and livelihoods in neighboring states and populated border areas, provoking protests, localized clashes over scarce supplies, and opportunistic militia violence that raises the rate of spillover incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">alliance_security_realig</data>
</edge>
<edge source="iran_us_standoff::refined_fuel_stocks" target="russia_ukraine_war::allied_military_support" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher commercial and strategic refined‑product inventories in Western suppliers enable continued bulk fuel deliveries, fuel-backed munitions and sustainment shipments for Ukrainian forces, whereas depletion forces allies to ration or postpone fuel‑dependent support, reducing effective military assistance.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
