  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained rise in global oil prices lifts headline inflation and inflation expectations, prompting markets to price in earlier or higher central-bank policy tightening.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_us_standoff</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_credit_stres</data>
