  <data key="d37">Improvements in deployed AI model capability for maritime ISR, anomaly detection and autonomous reconnaissance raise effective monitoring and attribution of hostile acts, strengthening deterrence and reducing the incidence of small-boat harassment and other disruptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_us_standoff</data>
</edge>
