  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising average model capability—driven by rivalry-driven R&amp;D—enables more effective planning, target recognition, and guidance tools that actors can use to select and strike energy infrastructure, increasing outages and stress on energy supplies supporting Ukraine and its neighbours as those tools are fielded.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
