  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened AI-focused regulation, export controls and enforcement increase compliance costs and legal uncertainty for foreign investors, causing them to reduce or reroute cross-border capital into jurisdictions perceived as higher regulatory risk.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_credit_stres</data>
