  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter regulatory scrutiny and export-control rulemaking tied to US–China rivalry create licensing delays and legal barriers that directly slow or block transfers of AI-enabled systems (drones, targeting software, logistics AI) from allies to Ukraine, reducing effective military support in the near term.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
