  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge of capital into AI equities, private rounds and infrastructure diverts demand away from long-duration sovereign and high-grade fixed income (portfolio rebalancing) and increases term premia, putting upward pressure on long-term nominal yields.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
