  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Acute illiquidity in global fixed-income markets precipitates disorderly sovereign bond moves and targeted losses for foreign investors, prompting formal protests, investigations or sanctions claims between affected states and raising bilateral diplomatic friction.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
