  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher cross-border capital inflows improve availability of trade finance, letters of credit and marine insurance for exporters and traders, enabling more tanker loadings and increasing crude volumes transiting key chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_credit_stres</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_us_standoff</data>
