  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden pullback in cross‑border capital flows reduces trade finance and working capital available to energy traders and operators, causing delayed cargoes, curtailed imports and increased short‑term stress in energy supply chains for importing countries.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
